# A project save cut short (only part of it there): LOAD leaves the project as it was ("SLOT EMPTY").
# (On the FM-1 a save whose check fails once read gives DAMAGED: A NEW PROJECT: a new project, not half of one.)
wait 300
demo 2
expect name DUST
storeput 0 tests/fixtures/cut-short.proj
tap SAVE
wait 150
expect page PROJECT
turn K1 1
wait 100
tap SAVE
wait 100
tap SAVE
wait 100
expect msg SLOT EMPTY
expect name DUST
